WEBVTT

00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:23.732
Perhaps letting you live back then
was a mistake.

00:00:26.318 --> 00:00:28.445
You've disappointed me.

00:02:16.011 --> 00:02:19.598
The Wings of Grief and Revenge

00:02:19.765 --> 00:02:21.892
<i>Even this neighborhood is dangerous now.</i>

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:24.478
<i>I heard the husband and wife</i>
<i>are both dead.</i>

00:02:24.561 --> 00:02:27.439
<i>Didn't Mr. Yoh have a young child?</i>

00:02:27.689 --> 00:02:28.690
<i>Poor thing.</i>

00:02:29.483 --> 00:02:30.817
<i>Isn't that the robber?</i>

00:02:31.276 --> 00:02:33.904
<i>My gosh. He's been beaten</i>
<i>beyond recognition.</i>

00:02:42.287 --> 00:02:45.123
<i>There was only one survivor.</i>
<i>Named Queenie Yoh.</i>

00:02:50.587 --> 00:02:51.630
Queenie!

00:02:51.922 --> 00:02:54.007
I'm happy to see you're awake!

00:02:54.549 --> 00:02:55.384
Where am I?

00:02:56.802 --> 00:02:57.928
Oh, that's right...

00:03:04.935 --> 00:03:08.146
You can't get up yet!
Your wounds might open.

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.439
Out of my way.

00:03:09.523 --> 00:03:11.608
There's something I have to do.

00:03:12.067 --> 00:03:13.276
Don't be ridiculous.

00:03:13.402 --> 00:03:15.195
What can you even do in that state?

00:03:16.571 --> 00:03:18.949
He just barely missed your vital organs.

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:20.409
Be happy you're alive.

00:03:21.785 --> 00:03:22.786
That man...

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:25.872
Wang wouldn't miss unless he meant to.

00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:28.375
He let me live on purpose.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.419
I see.

00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:33.255
This was removed
from a wound on your side.

00:03:34.798 --> 00:03:36.007
A microchip?

00:03:43.807 --> 00:03:45.016
He must have

00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:47.811
planted this as some kind of warning.

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:53.734
That lover boy of yours is truly insane.

00:03:55.444 --> 00:03:56.278
Queenie!

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:58.864
Anyway, your MOEV is wrecked.

00:03:59.197 --> 00:04:00.574
I know it's hard,

00:04:00.949 --> 00:04:02.617
but just calm down for now.

00:04:06.288 --> 00:04:08.248
What do you think? Is it fixable?

00:04:08.665 --> 00:04:11.543
My MOEV took the most damage.

00:04:12.419 --> 00:04:14.629
The VTOL unit takes priority.

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:16.256
Repair that first.

00:04:16.548 --> 00:04:17.966
I'm sure you're capable.

00:04:18.258 --> 00:04:20.761
Yeah, but Queenie is still...

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:24.222
Military personnel
will suffice as a pilot.

00:04:24.389 --> 00:04:26.475
All we need is the machine right now.

00:04:26.558 --> 00:04:29.686
But seeing how things went,
we're no match either way.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:33.398
Don't underestimate us.
I won't let the city be defiled again.

00:04:37.778 --> 00:04:41.490
I'm sure something like this
is a simple matter to you.

00:04:41.865 --> 00:04:44.493
To be strong means to constantly evolve.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.496
Don't you think so, Forze?

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:09.726
That's right.

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:13.605
That's what makes you
the strongest organism.

00:05:18.485 --> 00:05:20.821
Hellish Scorpion Soup.

00:05:21.112 --> 00:05:23.448
Cooked with a whole bottle of
Japanese peppers.

00:05:23.532 --> 00:05:25.408
Dig in! It's on the house.

00:05:25.784 --> 00:05:27.410
Wow! It looks amazi--

00:05:27.869 --> 00:05:30.455
It's sure to get you back in good health.

00:05:30.914 --> 00:05:32.999
It healed my fracture in just three days!

00:05:33.291 --> 00:05:36.211
Really?
It healed a bone in just three days?

00:05:36.336 --> 00:05:40.465
You're saying there are ingredients that
directly heal bone cells in here?

00:05:40.549 --> 00:05:43.552
What a pain. Don't take it so literally.

00:05:45.303 --> 00:05:47.013
Are you not hungry?

00:05:47.222 --> 00:05:51.226
I'll just have to press the
acupressure points that stimulate hunger.

00:05:52.978 --> 00:05:53.979
Nice job, Chloe!

00:05:55.146 --> 00:05:56.022
Suit yourself.

00:05:56.523 --> 00:05:58.733
So, how about you fill us in?

00:05:59.317 --> 00:06:01.611
We need to know the details.

00:06:03.488 --> 00:06:05.031
Long ago, Wang and I...

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.951
were disciples at the same
Sky God Fist School.

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:09.703
Sky God Fist School...

00:06:09.786 --> 00:06:13.456
Didn't they provide relief
following the reactor incident?

00:06:13.957 --> 00:06:16.001
But one day, Wang...

00:06:17.627 --> 00:06:19.963
<i>killed our teacher and fellow students,</i>

00:06:20.297 --> 00:06:22.424
<i>and disappeared into the underworld.</i>

00:06:24.676 --> 00:06:27.679
For some reason, he left only me alive.

00:06:28.555 --> 00:06:32.309
He was power hungry,
claiming that "Strength is justice."

00:06:32.559 --> 00:06:35.395
Is that why you're flying a MOEV?

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:38.398
To chase down that bird handler, Wang?

00:06:43.236 --> 00:06:44.279
Hao Wang.

00:06:44.779 --> 00:06:46.865
It looks as though that flying BRAI

00:06:46.948 --> 00:06:50.452
was Wang's pet falcon
before it underwent evolution.

00:06:51.202 --> 00:06:54.873
I think it's safe to assume
he was controlling it remotely.

00:06:56.207 --> 00:06:59.711
He made a show of
destroying only buildings I own.

00:07:00.795 --> 00:07:03.173
However, I have no recollection of him.

00:07:03.506 --> 00:07:07.010
The real question is,
who supplied him with a Dark Drive?

00:07:07.594 --> 00:07:09.930
They're likely the one with the grudge.

00:07:10.597 --> 00:07:12.098
Anyone come to mind?

00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:14.517
There must be more than a hundred.

00:07:15.143 --> 00:07:18.271
Opposition parties are
always making a mess of things.

00:07:18.647 --> 00:07:23.234
-Anyway, how is the machine doing?
-I've finished the repairs, but...

00:07:37.165 --> 00:07:38.625
What are you doing?

00:07:38.792 --> 00:07:40.585
You can't be pushing yourself!

00:07:40.961 --> 00:07:42.253
This isn't training.

00:07:42.712 --> 00:07:46.675
I'm improving the energy flow
inside my body to speed up healing.

00:07:46.758 --> 00:07:49.427
I see. I've actually heard of that before.

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:52.806
Sky God Fist is said to be
the highest form of yin-yang.

00:07:53.431 --> 00:07:54.432
Exactly.

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:57.227
Yin and yang, and kyo and jitsu.

00:07:57.644 --> 00:08:01.356
The mental and logical synchronization
with one's inner changes.

00:08:01.606 --> 00:08:03.608
It's almost like quantum physics.

00:08:04.109 --> 00:08:05.902
Take my hand and you can sample it.

00:08:06.736 --> 00:08:07.737
Oh, okay.

00:08:13.618 --> 00:08:14.661
What was that?

00:08:15.537 --> 00:08:17.956
Yin and yang, kyo and jitsu.

00:08:18.289 --> 00:08:20.083
Wow! Queenie, you're amazing!

00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:23.086
A higher dimension
where theory and practice meet.

00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:25.672
It might just be possible for her.

00:08:27.632 --> 00:08:29.551
Queenie, I have a favor to ask.

00:08:33.304 --> 00:08:34.222
The hyperdrive

00:08:34.305 --> 00:08:38.143
is a device powered by the quantum reactor
which amplifies energy.

00:08:38.518 --> 00:08:41.438
It accesses multiple dimensions
in parallel

00:08:41.563 --> 00:08:44.190
to draw power
many times greater than normal.

00:08:44.649 --> 00:08:49.112
However, this puts great strain
on the user's body and mind.

00:08:49.988 --> 00:08:52.490
Gren almost lost his life
trying to receive

00:08:52.824 --> 00:08:54.826
this huge amount of information.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:58.747
Just as you lost yourself
and went on a rampage?

00:08:59.247 --> 00:09:00.540
<i>That's right.</i>

00:09:00.957 --> 00:09:04.627
<i>There are yet many mysteries in the</i>
<i>theory and technology of the hyperdrive.</i>

00:09:05.628 --> 00:09:08.131
<i>But without it, we can't defeat the BRAI.</i>

00:09:08.882 --> 00:09:12.886
<i>So, I would like to install</i>
<i>a hyperdrive on your MOEV.</i>

00:09:13.636 --> 00:09:14.471
What?

00:09:14.929 --> 00:09:16.431
The only one who can use

00:09:16.681 --> 00:09:19.267
this VTOL-type MOEV in high-speed,
hand-to-hand combat,

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:20.643
is you, Queenie.

00:09:21.478 --> 00:09:23.021
As a student, you mastered

00:09:23.313 --> 00:09:25.607
the concepts of yin and yang,
and kyo and jitsu,

00:09:25.815 --> 00:09:28.193
meaning you can likely handle
the hyperdrive as well.

00:09:28.276 --> 00:09:29.944
I haven't mastered anything.

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:34.783
I can't even tame the dragon within me.

00:09:37.744 --> 00:09:41.706
If I use my power,
it will surely overtake me.

00:09:42.373 --> 00:09:43.374
Queenie...

00:09:50.131 --> 00:09:52.258
Thank you for repairing it, Leon.

00:09:54.385 --> 00:09:56.471
Even Mr. Scientist was turned down.

00:09:56.805 --> 00:09:59.182
She sure is committed to her man.

00:09:59.724 --> 00:10:00.975
I'll buy you a drink.

00:10:01.351 --> 00:10:03.186
Alcohol heals broken hearts.

00:10:03.812 --> 00:10:05.939
I could use a drink, but...

00:10:06.981 --> 00:10:10.360
<i>we need to figure out</i>
<i>how to fight without the VTOL-type.</i>

00:10:17.325 --> 00:10:18.743
It's almost time.

00:10:20.411 --> 00:10:24.499
Let's see how that
arrogant Princess' face looks

00:10:24.707 --> 00:10:26.376
when twisted in humiliation.

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:37.303
That damn bird from before
could appear again at any moment.

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.013
-Stay alert.
-Roger that.

00:10:39.931 --> 00:10:40.765
What's wrong?

00:10:40.849 --> 00:10:42.684
What is this? No way...

00:10:43.351 --> 00:10:44.769
The relative speed is...

00:10:54.195 --> 00:10:55.363
It came out of nowhere!

00:10:55.697 --> 00:10:57.282
Look at those insane wings!

00:10:57.365 --> 00:10:58.700
This thing's got it all.

00:10:58.825 --> 00:11:01.119
Its speed is a magnitude higher.

00:11:01.536 --> 00:11:02.704
This is bad.

00:11:03.329 --> 00:11:05.999
How did it evolve so much
in such a short time?

00:11:06.249 --> 00:11:07.625
Take air-defense positions!

00:11:08.084 --> 00:11:10.003
Pandora will provide support!

00:11:16.801 --> 00:11:19.053
Enemy BRAI has broken through
the air-defenses!

00:11:19.137 --> 00:11:21.014
It's reached the residential area!

00:11:21.097 --> 00:11:22.348
What is going on?

00:11:22.599 --> 00:11:24.475
Minor losses are of little concern.

00:11:24.809 --> 00:11:26.936
Protect the quantum reactor at all costs!

00:11:40.408 --> 00:11:41.868
This thing doesn't quit!

00:11:45.788 --> 00:11:47.665
Hide the city in a smokescreen?

00:11:48.124 --> 00:11:51.502
<i>Yes. A flashbang was effective last time.</i>

00:11:52.128 --> 00:11:53.379
<i>I believe that Wang</i>

00:11:53.713 --> 00:11:56.341
<i>uses the BRAI's eyes</i>
<i>to assess the situation.</i>

00:11:57.008 --> 00:11:59.010
<i>Unfortunately, the fog is thin today,</i>

00:11:59.135 --> 00:12:02.013
<i>but if we can put up a smokescreen,</i>

00:12:02.388 --> 00:12:04.432
<i>it may be helpful in reducing damage.</i>

00:12:04.974 --> 00:12:06.225
Please proceed.

00:12:28.247 --> 00:12:30.375
Those wings don't look very tasty.

00:12:30.625 --> 00:12:32.794
Now! For Neo Xianglong!

00:12:39.425 --> 00:12:40.593
The fools...

00:12:44.138 --> 00:12:45.473
The reactor incident

00:12:45.556 --> 00:12:48.267
caused strange creatures
to take over the world.

00:12:49.102 --> 00:12:51.229
Humanitarian aid should come second.

00:12:51.521 --> 00:12:54.524
As things are,
humanity itself will become extinct.

00:12:55.233 --> 00:12:57.944
We must gain even greater strength.

00:12:58.569 --> 00:13:01.614
Wang, what is this strength you speak of?

00:13:02.323 --> 00:13:05.785
I would acquire an unstoppable power
stronger than any other!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:11.416
By nature, martial arts
are not for the purpose of combat.

00:13:11.666 --> 00:13:14.627
Their true function
is to train the body and mind

00:13:14.711 --> 00:13:16.379
in order to help people in need.

00:13:16.462 --> 00:13:18.339
This is not the time for platitudes!

00:13:19.173 --> 00:13:21.300
The weak simply perish.

00:13:27.015 --> 00:13:28.599
I'm disappointed in you.

00:13:32.103 --> 00:13:33.312
In that case...

00:13:34.981 --> 00:13:37.150
I'll cull the weak myself.

00:13:41.237 --> 00:13:44.073
Spread out! Retreat! Hurry!

00:13:51.706 --> 00:13:52.540
Crap!

00:13:52.665 --> 00:13:54.542
That bird is kicking our asses!

00:13:55.043 --> 00:13:56.377
I never expected...

00:13:56.753 --> 00:13:58.463
It would attack so indiscriminately.

00:13:58.713 --> 00:14:00.882
It's now nothing more than a weapon.

00:14:01.257 --> 00:14:04.385
It no longer possesses the dignity
of a living being.

00:14:04.844 --> 00:14:07.680
Lifeline in the southwest urban district
has been destroyed!

00:14:07.764 --> 00:14:11.434
Food production factory three
has been severely damaged!

00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:14.687
Now that it's come to this,
is urban warfare the only way?

00:14:18.816 --> 00:14:20.610
She should be showing up soon.

00:14:26.574 --> 00:14:28.451
I'll defeat you this time!

00:14:29.118 --> 00:14:30.078
Queenie!

00:14:32.288 --> 00:14:33.122
It's fast!

00:14:38.419 --> 00:14:39.504
Interesting.

00:14:48.721 --> 00:14:49.806
Not bad...

00:14:50.181 --> 00:14:52.100
but those attacks are too light.

00:14:54.727 --> 00:14:55.561
Found you!

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:06.447
<i>Queenie! Use the hyperdrive!</i>

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:08.324
Leon...

00:15:08.533 --> 00:15:11.619
<i>There's an optical scanner installed</i>
<i>to the right of your console.</i>

00:15:11.953 --> 00:15:13.454
<i>That's the activation device.</i>

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:14.914
When did you do this?

00:15:15.081 --> 00:15:17.500
I'm sorry,
but I went ahead an installed it.

00:15:17.917 --> 00:15:18.918
<i>I told you already.</i>

00:15:19.419 --> 00:15:21.879
If I can't contain my own emotions,

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:24.048
I'll lose all control.

00:15:24.424 --> 00:15:25.925
If you take another direct hit,

00:15:26.092 --> 00:15:27.718
your MOEV will be done for.

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.389
<i>All hope will be lost then and there!</i>

00:15:34.350 --> 00:15:35.726
<i>You're our only chance.</i>

00:15:36.269 --> 00:15:37.437
<i>Master it!</i>

00:15:37.895 --> 00:15:38.980
<i>Tame it!</i>

00:15:39.605 --> 00:15:40.857
The mysterious power!

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:51.701
Whoa there!

00:15:56.372 --> 00:15:57.623
<i>Take heed, Queenie.</i>

00:15:58.708 --> 00:15:59.876
Your true opponent

00:16:00.293 --> 00:16:01.794
is your own heart.

00:16:03.463 --> 00:16:04.297
<i>Master...</i>

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:07.383
<i>Please watch over me!</i>

00:16:15.933 --> 00:16:17.268
The curtain rises...

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:19.312
on the second act.

00:16:42.001 --> 00:16:43.711
Damn it. What's going on?

00:16:44.545 --> 00:16:46.756
<i>It's going to</i>
<i>slam her into the bridge again!</i>

00:16:56.015 --> 00:16:58.893
<i>Tame the dragon within.</i>

00:16:59.769 --> 00:17:03.022
Overpower the waves
of fear and angst in your heart.

00:17:03.272 --> 00:17:06.692
Put yourself in the midst
of the powerful current.

00:17:06.984 --> 00:17:10.404
Everything in this world is kyo and jitsu,
yin and yang.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.996
Terraroid Formation.

00:17:33.594 --> 00:17:34.554
What the...

00:17:36.264 --> 00:17:37.348
<i>It's activated!</i>

00:17:47.233 --> 00:17:48.234
Holy...

00:17:48.359 --> 00:17:50.069
Now, that's what I call kung fu!

00:17:51.153 --> 00:17:52.405
Amazing.

00:17:52.947 --> 00:17:55.533
You truly are the rival I was hoping for!

00:18:00.746 --> 00:18:04.875
<i>You're more than a match</i>
<i>for Forze and its Dark Drive!</i>

00:18:11.716 --> 00:18:13.759
After the Xianglong Crisis...

00:18:14.302 --> 00:18:17.847
the BRAI should have become
the strongest lifeforms on earth.

00:18:18.306 --> 00:18:20.349
So, what is this amazing strength?

00:18:34.405 --> 00:18:37.450
Sky God Style Phantom Ice Blade Fist.

00:18:42.747 --> 00:18:43.748
Forze.

00:18:45.124 --> 00:18:46.459
We can

00:18:47.251 --> 00:18:49.211
become even stronger!

00:19:12.777 --> 00:19:13.778
Wang...

00:19:15.905 --> 00:19:18.366
<i>I never thought the attacks</i>
<i>would reach the city.</i>

00:19:18.449 --> 00:19:21.410
Luckily,
there were few civilian casualties.

00:19:21.494 --> 00:19:24.413
That squad
the Princess created fought, too, right?

00:19:24.497 --> 00:19:25.331
I'm so hungry!

00:19:25.498 --> 00:19:26.957
<i>Cheers!</i>

00:19:27.041 --> 00:19:28.376
<i>Cheers!</i>

00:19:28.459 --> 00:19:30.836
<i>Have as much as you want tonight.</i>

00:19:31.045 --> 00:19:32.546
<i>Queenie!</i>

00:19:32.797 --> 00:19:34.632
<i>Welcome to the Pandora squad!</i>

00:19:34.924 --> 00:19:37.468
<i>You just need to sign the contract later,</i>
<i>okay?</i>

00:19:38.219 --> 00:19:39.762
<i>G-- Got it.</i>

00:19:40.971 --> 00:19:42.014
Queenie...

00:19:43.224 --> 00:19:45.518
Why did the Secretary hire more outsiders?

00:19:46.602 --> 00:19:47.853
They're useful.

00:19:48.521 --> 00:19:50.815
See? I convinced her to join us.

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:52.983
It was Leon who convinced her.

00:19:54.777 --> 00:19:58.614
Queenie, are you tired?
Want to celebrate with a--

00:19:58.781 --> 00:19:59.782
No.

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:00.991
Not that it matters,

00:20:01.534 --> 00:20:05.746
but why did you change your mind
after being so determined to go it alone?

00:20:06.455 --> 00:20:09.041
Couldn't stand being apart from me?

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:10.626
Th-- That's not it!

00:20:11.419 --> 00:20:13.170
They didn't find Wang's body.

00:20:13.963 --> 00:20:15.047
<i>If he's still alive,</i>

00:20:15.381 --> 00:20:17.133
<i>he may come after me again.</i>

00:20:18.384 --> 00:20:21.637
Moreover, mastering the hyperdrive

00:20:21.887 --> 00:20:24.432
leads to taming the dragon
within yourself.

00:20:26.058 --> 00:20:28.185
I'll use this chance to train you, too.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.065
Then, why doesn't Gren join us, too?

00:20:33.858 --> 00:20:35.151
Why me?

00:20:35.484 --> 00:20:38.863
She only beat me before
because I was drunk.

00:20:38.946 --> 00:20:41.115
I'm much more capable than that!

00:20:41.449 --> 00:20:43.242
Whatever you say, Sarge.

00:20:43.409 --> 00:20:45.411
It's not Sarge! It's Captain!

00:20:45.494 --> 00:20:46.662
Either's fine.

00:20:46.746 --> 00:20:48.831
They're clearly very different!
Say it right!

00:20:48.914 --> 00:20:50.458
-Yeah, sure.
-Queenie,

00:20:50.666 --> 00:20:52.334
you're not eating again.

00:20:52.626 --> 00:20:54.420
<i>Are you still on a diet?</i>

00:20:54.628 --> 00:20:55.880
<i>That's not it.</i>

00:20:56.088 --> 00:20:58.215
<i>Queenie, could it be that...</i>

00:21:04.221 --> 00:21:05.931
you can't eat spicy food?

00:21:09.769 --> 00:21:11.187
<i>I can't take it any longer!</i>

00:21:11.312 --> 00:21:14.106
<i>Master! Three almond jellies,</i>
<i>sesame dumplings, sponge cake,</i>

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:15.900
<i>and bird's nest coconut soup, please!</i>

00:21:16.275 --> 00:21:17.443
Right away!

00:21:18.027 --> 00:21:19.028
Coming up.

00:21:20.196 --> 00:21:22.031
They're all desserts.

00:21:22.323 --> 00:21:23.157
I see.

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:26.160
So the hyperdrive affects
each person's appetite differently.

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:27.912
That's fine.

00:21:28.287 --> 00:21:30.372
It brings out her charm.

00:21:34.376 --> 00:21:35.586
I'm in paradise!

00:21:35.961 --> 00:21:38.631
<i>A woman fighter with a sweet tooth, huh?</i>

00:21:39.173 --> 00:21:41.592
<i>Queenie is adorable!</i>

00:21:44.053 --> 00:21:47.598
<i>This is the Dark Drive</i>
<i>extracted from the BRAI the other day.</i>

00:21:48.349 --> 00:21:52.019
<i>This one doesn't appear to be</i>
<i>fully merged with the cells yet.</i>

00:21:52.561 --> 00:21:56.941
Yes. In other words,
it was clearly artificially implanted.

00:21:57.983 --> 00:21:59.068
Which means...

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:02.279
There is someone out there using the BRAI.

00:22:02.571 --> 00:22:05.407
Yes, but who could it be?

00:22:07.868 --> 00:22:10.996
<i>Tremble in fear as you lay...</i>

00:22:12.039 --> 00:22:13.791
Princess.

00:23:46.800 --> 00:23:50.346
THE PHANTOM PANDA

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:51.889
Subtitle translation by Amanda Miller
